Authors@R: person("Rodney J.", "Dyer", email = "rjdyer@vcu.edu",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: This package is deprecated and no longer maintained.
    Constructs and analyzes 'Population Graphs', a graph-theoretic
    topology based upon conditional genetic covariance. Provides tools for
    spatial integration of graph topologies with existing packages including
    'sp', 'sf', and 'ggplot2'.
